<div class="danger-zone">
  <div class="danger-header">危险操作</div>
  <div class="danger-body">
    <%= image_tag "icons/danger.png", size: "50x50", class: "island-icon", style: "float: left; margin-right: var(--spacing-lg);" %>
    <div>
      <h5 class="island-title mb-1">删除标签</h5>
      <p>
        请注意，此操作不仅会删除引用，还会删除实际内容！
        <br /><br />
        例如，当 <strong>latest</strong> 和 <strong>v1.2.3</strong> 指向同一个镜像时，<br />
        删除 <strong>latest</strong> 也会永久移除 <strong>v1.2.3</strong>。
      </p>

      <a href="#" class="btn btn-danger" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#delete-dialog">
        删除
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="delete-dialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h4 class="modal-title text-danger" id="myModalLabel">确认删除？</h4>
      <button type="button" class="modal-close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <p>
        此操作将永久删除 <strong><%= @tag.name %></strong> 标签。
      </p>
      <div class="form-group">
        <%= label_tag :delete_confirm, "请输入标签名称以启用删除按钮。" %>
        <%= text_field_tag :delete_confirm, nil, class: "form-control", data: { expected: @tag.name }, placeholder: "请输入标签名称 ..." %>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-dismiss="modal">取消</button>
      <%= link_to "删除", tag_path(@repository.name, @tag.name), data:{turbo_method: :delete}, id: "delete-button", class: "btn btn-danger disabled" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
